=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Green Thumb Moogle} for a cutscene. You do not need to zone following completing the other quests.
* He will ask for you to plant the {i:Fruit Seeds|Fruit Seeds|574} he gives you along with {i:Sunsand|Sunsand|503} as fertilizer.
** If spoken to again while the quest is active, he will encourage you to "grab some crab chow and show those strange girls what a green thumb really means!"
* Harvest or obtain a {i:Tropical Cactus|Tropical Cactus|9232} and trade it to {n:Green Thumb Moogle} for a final cutscene.
** You can purchase a {i:Tropical Cactus|Tropical Cactus|9232} directly off the AH under Others > Misc to skip any waiting on harvesting or having to obtain a {i:Sunsand|Sunsand|503}.
** If you decide to do it yourself, you can obtain {i:Sunsand|Sunsand|503} from:
*** The ??? in {z:Valkurm Dunes} at (H-9) during dusty weather or,
*** Purchase it on the {z:Auction House} under Others > Misc.
**** Once obtained, plant any seed (including the {i:Fruit Seeds|Fruit Seeds|574} you just obtained) and fertilize it with a {i:Sunsand|Sunsand|503}.
**** A {i:Revival Tree Root|Revival Tree Root|940} will work and only takes one hour to mature.
**** {i:Tropical Cactus|Tropical Cactus|9232} is not guaranteed with any combination but will eventually be harvested. You may need multiple {i:Sunsands|Sunsand|503}.
* After the cutscene you'll receive {i:Sheep Mount} as a reward.
** Note that you directly receive the {@k} {k:Sheep companion} instead of the item {i:Sheep Mount}.

=2 Notes
* This quest was added in the {p:July 2016 Version Update|July 2016 Version Update Changes}.

